    "detailed_description": "Containment Corps is an online multiplayer cooperative first person experience. The game combines elements of resource management and traditional FPS themes to create an exhilarating team-based encounter. <br><br>You and a team of specialized units have been called upon to quell an uprising of contaminated swamp creatures. Choose your loadout and coordinate your defense; utilize unique abilities and powerful turrets to repel the onslaught. Keep the operation running. Manage your crystal energy supply to maintain full-base functionality, upgrade defenses, and power up weapons. Collect more by harvesting dead enemies. <br><br>[Scaled Survival: Assemble a team to survive as long as possible. Play alone or with friends!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693830/extras/58b991551dfe581f61077d72760e1fff.poster.avif?t=1634427247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693830/extras/58b991551dfe581f61077d72760e1fff.webm?t=1634427247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693830/extras/58b991551dfe581f61077d72760e1fff.mp4?t=1634427247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Equip various items to give unique abilities or perks some of which include:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Airstrike<br></li><li> Landmine<br></li><li> Stun trap<br></li><li> Grenades<br></li><li> Shotgun<br></li><li> Automatic Turret<br></li><li> Powershield</li></ul>And many more!<br><br>Play in one of three maps<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Swamp<br></li><li> Desert<br></li><li> Canyon</li></ul><br>It will take a well organized and balanced team to resist the hordes<br><br><i>How long can you survive?</i>",
    "about_the_game": "Containment Corps is an online multiplayer cooperative first person experience. The game combines elements of resource management and traditional FPS themes to create an exhilarating team-based encounter. <br><br>You and a team of specialized units have been called upon to quell an uprising of contaminated swamp creatures. Choose your loadout and coordinate your defense; utilize unique abilities and powerful turrets to repel the onslaught. Keep the operation running. Manage your crystal energy supply to maintain full-base functionality, upgrade defenses, and power up weapons. Collect more by harvesting dead enemies. <br><br>[Scaled Survival: Assemble a team to survive as long as possible. Play alone or with friends!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693830/extras/58b991551dfe581f61077d72760e1fff.poster.avif?t=1634427247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693830/extras/58b991551dfe581f61077d72760e1fff.webm?t=1634427247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693830/extras/58b991551dfe581f61077d72760e1fff.mp4?t=1634427247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Equip various items to give unique abilities or perks some of which include:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Airstrike<br></li><li> Landmine<br></li><li> Stun trap<br></li><li> Grenades<br></li><li> Shotgun<br></li><li> Automatic Turret<br></li><li> Powershield</li></ul>And many more!<br><br>Play in one of three maps<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Swamp<br></li><li> Desert<br></li><li> Canyon</li></ul><br>It will take a well organized and balanced team to resist the hordes<br><br><i>How long can you survive?</i>",
